        "original_id": "5066a0f5-5d42-5a1e-8796-25d5feb3b171",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Destiny, Five Nights at Freddy's, Sunset Overdrive, Titanfall, The Evil Within, Watch Dogs\n- Places: Freddy Fazbear's Pizza\n- Roles: Night security guard\n- Concepts: New intellectual properties, haunted animatronics, security cameras\n\nFacts:\n- In 2014, the video game industry saw the release of new intellectual properties including Destiny, Five Nights at Freddy's, Sunset Overdrive, Titanfall, The Evil Within, and Watch Dogs.\n- Five Nights at Freddy's is a video game centered on a fictional pizza restaurant called Freddy Fazbear's Pizza.\n- In Five Nights at Freddy's, the player acts as a night security guard.\n- In Five Nights at Freddy's, the night security guard defends against malfunctioning, haunted animatronic characters.\n- In Five Nights at Freddy's, the player tracks animatronic movement through the facility by using security cameras.",
